<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Bar graph showing order book changes over two timestamps, t and t+1. The left chart shows red asks above green bids, with prices increasing upwards. Labels indicate best ask-price, best bid-price, and mid-price. Timestamp t+1 adds a market order rectangle, executed at the best bid-price, reducing ask depth.) /K 518 0 R /P 226 0 R /Pg 217 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
